msgstr "Preferirani grad (podrazumevano u katalogu)"

msgid "4. Third-Party Disclosures"
msgstr "4. Otkrivanje trećim stranama"

msgid "Telegram"
msgstr "Telegram"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"authentication and seller-buyer contact relay via deep-links (<code>t.me/"
"%(bot_username)s</code>). No ad content is shared; only the identifiers "
"needed for the action."
msgstr ""
"autentifikacija i prenos kontakta prodavca-kupca putem deep-linkova "
"(<code>t.me/%(bot_username)s</code>). Sadržaj oglasa se ne deli; samo "
"identifikatori potrebni za akciju."

msgid "Google Translate"
msgstr "Google Translate"

msgid ""
"best-effort, non-identifying language normalization of ad text. No personal "
"data (telegram_id, username, IP) is transmitted."
msgstr ""
"naporan, neidentifikovajući jezički normalizationni tekst oglasa. Lični "
"podaci (telegram_id, korisničko ime, IP) se ne prenose."

msgid "Plausible Analytics"
msgstr "Plausible Analytics"

msgid ""
"cookieless, privacy-friendly traffic analytics. Loaded only after you accept "
"the analytics category."
msgstr ""
"analitika saobraćaja bez kolačića, prijateljska privatnosti. Učitava se samo "
"nakon što prihvatite kategoriju analitike."

msgid "5. Your Rights"
msgstr "5. Vaša prava"

msgid "Under GDPR you have the right to:"
msgstr "Prema GDPR-u imate pravo na:"

msgid "Access and obtain a copy of your personal data."
msgstr "Pristupiti i dobiti kopiju vaših ličnih podataka."

msgid "Rectify inaccurate personal data."
msgstr "Ispraviti netačne lične podatke."

msgid "Erase your personal data (\"right to be forgotten\")."
msgstr "Izbrisati vaše lične podatke (\"pravo na zaborav\")."

msgid "Restrict or object to processing."
msgstr "Ograničiti ili zameraći obradi."

msgid "Data portability."
msgstr "Prenosljivost podataka."

msgid "Withdraw consent at any time, as easily as you gave it."
msgstr "Povući pristanak u bilo koje vreme, jednostavno kao što ste ga dao."

msgid "Lodge a complaint with a supervisory authority."
msgstr "Podneti žalbu nadzornom organu."

msgid "6. Erasure and Retention"
msgstr "6. Brisanje i zadržavanje"

msgid ""
"When you withdraw consent, your account and its advertisements are\n"
"                soft-deleted immediately. All personal data is permanently "
"erased\n"
"                within <strong>30 days</strong> of withdrawal. Consent state "
"is otherwise\n"
"                retained for 12 months, after which you are re-prompted."
msgstr ""
"Kada povučete pristanak, vaš nalog i njegove oglase odmah će biti obrisani "
"(soft-delete). Svi lični podaci će biti trajno izbrisani u roku od 30 dana "
"od povlačenja. Stanje pristanka će inače biti zadržano 12 meseci, nakon čega "
"ćete biti ponovo upitani."

msgid "7. Manage Your Consent"
msgstr "7. Upravljajte vašim pristanakom"

msgid "You can revisit and change your consent choices at any time. Use the"
msgstr ""
"Možete ponovo posetiti i promeniti vaše izbore pristanka u bilo koje vreme. "
"Koristite"

msgid "link to open the consent banner, or contact us on Telegram at"
msgstr ""
"link da otvorite banner pristanka, ili kontaktirajte nas putem Telegrama na"

